Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(阿巴拉契亚山脉单车径  温泉地区)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0015,,《致命弯道6：终极审判》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(霍布温泉庄园  始于1902年)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚差点没跟上我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost lost me back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么 这是什么地方 - 特别的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, what is this place? - Someplace special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是小孩时有一次跟家里人 露营发现了这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found this on a family camping trip when I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水是温的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 这是温泉啊 你这个呆瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. They're hot springs, you goof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 水还有点热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo! It's hot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这足够吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:02:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 如果你真的想 回归自然…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you really wanna go back to nature...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 热热的真舒服 - 答应我 我们每年都泡泡温泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's nice and hot. - Promise we'll do this every year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.85,0:02:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到年华老去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until we wrinkle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.88,0:03:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你受伤了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetie, are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达里亚 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daria! Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here! Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你摔倒了 - 没有 有人他妈的射了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you fall? - No. Someone fucking shot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就一点儿不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you had no idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是被收养的 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's adopted, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 托妮 只是从大一才开始认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Toni, having only known him since freshman year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过还是挺酷的 是不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still kind of cool, though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现你 其实还有家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finding out you actually had some family out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是他家人 不然我们怎么会过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are his family. That's why we're all here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我哥和那些人会 跟在我们后面一起来的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's why my brother and those guys are right behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我不知道此行会遇到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't know what to expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识这些人 也没来过这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know these people or this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我将要继承莫泰6\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could be inheriting a Motel 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又或… 一个毒枭集团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or... a meth empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说说 这是阿巴拉契亚山脉啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying, it's the Appalachians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我谢谢你 维克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Vic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我可以帮到你的话 我做了些调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it'll help, I did some digging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你又不用这个写专栏 - 当然不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't for one of your columns. - Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只喜欢调查研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just the investigative type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍布温泉庄园 被某个未知家族于1926年建立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hobb Springs, established 1926 by families unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是你的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国第一所位于巴特尔克里 郊外的疗养院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first sanitarium in America outside Battle Creek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 大多数人会同意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, most people would approve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 同意什么 - 我去疗养院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of what? - Me going into a sanitarium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾格尼丝 菲尔兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agnes Fields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:06:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你得用自己的 - 就这么说定了 杰克森先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are gonna get yours. - I'll hold you to that, Mr. Jackson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更像一个养生矿泉疗养院 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's more like a health spa, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疗养院不会建户外厕所 布莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spas don't come with their own outhouse, Bryan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜莉安 就两周 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jillian, it's two weeks, OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 把丹尼弄到户外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, getting Danny out in the open air,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个继承物到底怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seeing how much of an inheritance this really is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 罗德 我修轮胎就这么让人惊奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, Rod? Me fixing a tire is so amazing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只是试试我的新摄像机 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just playing with my new camera. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.27,0:07:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次旅行你用你的旧摄像机 把我的裸照晒得全网都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your old camera posted my naked ass all over the internet last trip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一天点击量就是4000啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And got 4,000 hits in one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再者说了 这也挺有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, come on, it's fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愉快是我们都需要的治疗方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fun is just the kind of therapy we all need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 特别是我妹妹和丹尼 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Especially my sister and Danny. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱愉快疗法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta love therapy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想开始康复进程吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna start the healing process?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今早晨照了6次镜子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've checked yourself six times this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他很快会来 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'll be here real soon. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还得一会呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may take some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.79,0:08:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我过不了另一个冬天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go another winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽量争取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We play this right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妹妹 他抗拒不了你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sister, he won't be able to resist you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝知道我抗拒不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord knows I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 这简直巨大啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys, it's gigantic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你继承了这个 - 我想是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You inherited this? - I guess so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个国家的一个小地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our little place in the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.57,0:09:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 这可不是莫泰6\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it ain't a Motel 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刷几层漆的话 就是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple coats of paint, and it could be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的太雄伟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creepy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克 下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vic, get out of the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟我男朋友单独呆会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a moment alone with my boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.71,0:09:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该决定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正当我的人生陷入 最低谷的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just when I hit the lowest I've ever hit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我收到一封信 信上说我属于某种东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a letter saying that I belonged to something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我几年前放弃的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something that I gave up on years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.73,0:09:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你想怎么做 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what you wanna do, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想见见这些人 了解关于我的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna meet these people and find out what I'm all about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 老天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 - 哇喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太宏伟了 - 我知道 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's huge. - I know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.64,0:10:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到霍布温泉庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Hobb Springs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 丹尼 - 是我 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Danny. - That's right, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看你的眼睛就知道是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could tell by your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信你可算来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot believe that you are finally here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你哪位 - 这应该是萨莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And who are you? - This would be Sally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫杰克森 我们是管理员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Jackson. We're the caretakers here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道你朋友会来 不过 呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We weren't expecting your friends, but, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我确定我们可以接待你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm pretty sure we can handle you, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我们只是第一波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we're just the first wave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方简直太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is huge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会迷路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we even gonna find our way around in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们管这叫温泉疗养院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call this a spa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好撒点面包屑做记号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better leave a trail of breadcrumbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们轮胎破了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a flat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后有点… - 醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and then got a little... - Baked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绕圈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turned around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 没问题 我们房间很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see, no problem. We have plenty of vacancies coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别但心 他们今天就退房 然后这地方就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, they'll be checking out today and then we'll have the place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 都是我的了 - 哦 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- all to ourselves. - Oh, goody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很乐意带你们到处转转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be happy to show you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 要不我们先把包拿进去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, maybe we could get our bags first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 也许该分房间了 旅途疲惫啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, maybe some rooms. It's been a long drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想怎样都行 我们现在为你们工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you wish. We work for you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty cool, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 丹尼现在有仆人了 - 嘿 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Danny has servants now? - Hey, how you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ya'll come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为乡下人来说他们相当漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're kind of good-looking for hillbillies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是表兄妹 不是 哥哥和妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're cousins. No, brother and sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same thing around these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了 他们也许只是普通夫妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, they're probably just a normal couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们长得挺逗的 - 像阿米希人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're funny-looking. - And Amish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:11:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在我们的贵格会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're kissing cousins on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟姐妹那边可以接吻的表兄妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our Quaker brother's sister's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真对不起 我们失礼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, that was so rude of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的风言风语以前也有不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't nothing we haven't heard before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我就不当回事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let it roll off my back nowadays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的是兄妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you really are brother and sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如我所说 我们没想到会来这么多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I said, we weren't expecting so many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想吃的话 我们再做点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can make more, if you'd like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不 不 没关系 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, no, no, it's fine. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这休息一下 我们想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll leave you here to rest a spell while we figure out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样最好地服务你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how best to deal with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧 坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们真要呆在这里 - 怎么了 有什么不妥吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're really staying here? - Why, what's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:13:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切无疑透着古怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no doubt all of this is a little bit weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.31,0:13:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 - 你们没觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - You guys don't get{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方挺有吸引力的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the charm of this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拆了这里 细分这片土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You rip the place down, subdivide the land,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们回来 我们会请某人 过来做个真正的保价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we go back, we'll send someone in for a real appraisal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我想你忘了我没地方可去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think you're forgetting that I don't have anywhere to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 那么这就是你家喽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, so this is your home now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 你过去混中央公园的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny, you're used to Central Park West{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 周五晚上都是随叫随到 - 是啊 看看我的下场吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and Nobu on Friday nights. - Yeah. And look what that did to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我们不需要现在就做决定 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we don't have to make a decision right away. It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方是有生命的 有它的历史 隐秘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is alive. It has history, secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少两个星期会不断给我们惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough excitement for two weeks at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 维克 支持我一下 - 呃 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, back me up, Vic. - Uh, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.75,0:13:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样有年代的地方 一定有它自己的标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place this old surely has a book in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许说不定还被用作电影素材呢 - 除了谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe a movie even. - Short of murder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者某个好莱坞丑闻 谁在意呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or a Hollywood scandal, who'd give a shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在意啊 布莱恩 我们可能正在讨论我的家族史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, Bryan. We could be talking about my history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 所以我同意留下 - 好 我也留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So me. - Yeah, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我留下 - 得忠于家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me. - Gotta stick by family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我摇铃叫的那个高高的 强壮男人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the big, strong man I rang for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.93,0:15:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才像话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's more like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克森先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jackson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 哦…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?! Oh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shhh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的老太婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly little bitty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,控制点自己 伙计们 这是我的唯一要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little self control, boys! That's all I ask!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天 这是真的金子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! Is that real gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 布莱恩 赫普怀特纯手工家具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Bryan! These are Hepplewhite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些不看古董路演的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for those that don't watch Antique Roadshow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 保存得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and they look to be in perfect condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.47,0:16:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 有它们的价值难以值量 - 难以估量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, they're gonna be worth a fortune. - A fortune?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.67,0:16:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你觉得我的家怎样啊 布莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you like my place now, Bryan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计们 这地方好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. This place just got a whole lot better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 哦 好么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's he going now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们脱了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里闻着真香\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It actually smells sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计们 我们要泡就要有点风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys, if we're gonna do this, we're gonna do this in style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们准备好了吗 - 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ready for it? - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 多谢啊 老兄 - 进来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, man. - Come on in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方够大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's room for everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 你没事吧 - 这些真的都是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. You OK? - It's really all mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没想明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still wrapping my head around that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们需要这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's just what we needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.69,0:17:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们得在这里将就了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose this will have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕这是我们仅有的寝室了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid this is all we have right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧 我们是这位新房主的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? We're the new owner's best friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你可以安排得更好点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can do better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都到了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we all here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们玩那些骑车的人玩得很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you boys had your fun with those bikers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们也摧残了那小姑娘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you messed with the little bitty real nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now quit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰丹尼 即是这意味着也不能碰他的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave Danny alone. Even if it means giving his friends a pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我说得很明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I thought I made myself clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会等很久的 你们可以尽情围猎他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be long, and you can all have at 'em as much as you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们还这么做的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you keep doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会毁了我们所有人要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you're doing you're gonna ruin this for all of us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.89,0:19:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说得够明白了吗 明白了没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I make myself clear? Do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操蛋的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你要怎么用这个摄像机 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, like, what's the plan with the cameras, dude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你走哪都带着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, you're carrying them around everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 老兄 看 小巧易隐藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, man. Look. Compact and easy to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们应该把这个放在丹尼的房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should put one of these in Danny's room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我可不能去看我姐姐的裸照 但还是要感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm not up for seeing my sister naked, but thank you, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么拍我们怎么样 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what about the rest of us, dude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这贱货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请告诉我你把这个拍下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me you got a camera for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it here, give it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要感谢学院授予我的崇高奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to thank the Academy for this prestigious award.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:22:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会每天享用它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will enjoy this every single day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说让我们掏钱来采购 公平何在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me how it's fair that we have to pay for groceries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的小狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor puppy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 布莱恩 - 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bryan. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.17,0:22:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们只是路过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You folks just passing through?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们住在霍布温泉庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're staying up at Hobb Springs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己可不想再去那里了 但我想又快要去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get up there much myself anymore, but I expect I will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.79,0:22:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 为什么 - 你们刚住进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, why is that? - You just got in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.22,0:22:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.49,0:22:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看到一群老女人在那欢腾吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all see a bunch of little, old ladies be-bopping around up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.49,0:22:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是的 你指的是美国革命女儿会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. The Daughters of the Revolution?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是 可怜的她们都记不起这个老太婆是否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be them. Poor things can't remember if this woman got back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.67,0:22:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到了大巴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on that bus or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾格尼丝 菲尔茨 听说过她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agnes Fields, you hear of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我们是刚来不久 所以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Like I said, we just got here, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.21,0:23:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像你们这样可爱的小俩口 在霍布温泉做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what is a lovely couple like you doing settling in Hobb Springs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这样的 我们的朋友继承了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, our friend inherited it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.01,0:23:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 真不错 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, nice for him, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.42,0:23:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我个忙 拿一张去那里给大家看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take one of these up there, do me a favor, show it around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.15,0:23:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的话 也许有人会认出她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we get lucky and her face will ring a bell with somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 有奖励吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, is there a reward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure thing, officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法想象她究竟会出什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think what could have happened to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 你保重 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- OK. Well, take care. - See ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个热门玩意在这里不管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get this hot spot to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看见丹尼了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you guys seen Danny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.35,0:23:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 一分钟前在这里转过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he just wandered through here a minute ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.39,0:23:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别管他 让他尽情享受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone, Mom, he's enjoying himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么不对头吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something wrong? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来吧 我们去找他 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Let's go find him. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方有点让我毛骨悚然的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess this place just gives me the creeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 我们到处在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny. We've been looking all over for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.21,0:24:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.05,0:24:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来看一下这些相片 我不知道是否该看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at this picture and tell me if I should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.32,0:24:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙很像丹尼啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy kind of looks like Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至有些女人都很像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even some of the women do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个饭店的全部历史都在这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole history of this hotel's up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人怎么一个也不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I not know any of these people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.60,0:24:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些相片最近的也是70年代了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These pictures only go up to the '70s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.97,0:24:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你这边的家族搬走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe your side of the family moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.67,0:24:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是全部 看那张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everybody, though. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们看到了你的表兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we just met your cousins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.01,0:24:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.18,0:24:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他们把自己全罩起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell are they all covered up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.12,0:24:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个我可替你破解不了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how to break this to you, man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.95,0:24:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们在这里看到是典型的山区繁殖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what we have here is classic mountain breeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.82,0:24:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闭嘴 - 我是说 这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop. - I'm just saying, there's bound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.99,0:25:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定给后人带来一些缺陷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be a few defects along the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.36,0:25:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的闭嘴吧 - 你听到没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop. Seriously. - You heard him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.53,0:25:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们是山里人 生活方式适应不了现代社会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think 'cause we're mountain folk, our ways ain't fit for fine society?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里接待过形形色色的人 包括三位总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had all sorts stay here, including three presidents:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泰迪·罗斯福 卡尔文·柯立芝和杰佛逊·戴维斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teddy Roosevelt, Calvin Coolidge, and Jefferson Davis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.01,0:25:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有一个抱怨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not one had a complaint!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.21,0:25:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 杰佛逊·戴维斯 - 没事了 杰克逊 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jefferson Davis? - It's OK, Jackson. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是在捣乱 是吗 维克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was just messing around. Weren't you, Vic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.12,0:25:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我只是为我所继承的感到骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'm just very proud of my heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.16,0:25:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家族的确驯化了这片土地 把它变成了别的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Families really tamed this land, they made it into something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.16,0:25:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里非常不错 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's impressive. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.39,0:25:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.73,0:25:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想看看真的不错的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna see something really impressive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.80,0:25:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.71,0:25:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.98,0:25:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别去碰 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't touch. - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.57,0:26:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼力很好丹尼 这是你爷爷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a good eye, Danny. It belonged to your grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.70,0:26:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他精通弓箭 - 这里到处是生物克星啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was hell with a bow. - The bane of critters everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.07,0:26:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么 亲爱的 - 我爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it, honey? - My grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.38,0:26:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的爷爷 我难以相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandfather. I just can't believe I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.01,0:26:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至还有个爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even had a grand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.45,0:26:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请感觉一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Give it a feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.76,0:26:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 那么紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, that's tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用箭打过猎吗 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever been bow hunting, Danny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.74,0:26:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never been hunting, period.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.57,0:26:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿它还是这样保存着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like to keep it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.37,0:26:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 这可不是个好的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's hardly a proper view, miss,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.24,0:26:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想你连一次也没试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}considering you haven't even tried it once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.59,0:27:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 感觉适应吗 - 我正在适应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fit OK? - I'm getting used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.49,0:27:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你女朋友 她可真的不愿意让你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your girl, she really didn't want you to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.16,0:27:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她只是保护意识 他们都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just being protective. They all are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.40,0:27:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和那个开着豪车带着姑娘的家伙很相称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy with the fancy car and girl to match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.77,0:27:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩 我们以前一起共事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bryan? We used to work together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.50,0:27:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在发生… 这一切之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before it all... happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.84,0:27:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前在华尔街干 后来遇到暴跌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to be on Wall Street. Had a bit of a meltdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.31,0:27:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这样的结果似乎很正常 - 不是人人都这样认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seems an appropriate reaction. - Not everybody thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.32,0:27:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的公司不这样认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not my company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是我的客户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely not my clients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.49,0:27:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弄丢了好多人的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost a lot of people's money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括布莱恩的 托妮的 还有我自己的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including Bryan's, Toni's, my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.96,0:27:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想那就是你分辨谁才是你真正朋友的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that's when you find out who your real friends are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.93,0:27:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那些愿意支持你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones who stand by you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.98,0:27:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们是觉得你欠了他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they think you owe them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.20,0:27:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.00,0:27:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也太让人尴尬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was all so embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.94,0:28:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不适合说那种荒谬的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't suited to that nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.88,0:28:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的一面来看 那就是我们如何找到你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the plus side, it's how we found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.05,0:28:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里是有网络可以使用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do have the internet out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.45,0:28:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你是在谷歌上找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you found me through Google?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.95,0:28:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 花了好长时间呢 但是找到你对我们说很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Took a long time. But it was important we found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.62,0:28:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来经营旅馆 - 还有其他事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To run a hotel? - Amongst other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.67,0:28:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该往上爬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to climb up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.08,0:28:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是别人的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't belong to somebody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.98,0:28:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里所有东西都是属于我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything on this land belongs to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.55,0:28:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.93,0:28:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啤酒来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beer has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.21,0:29:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 过来吧 伙计 - 靠 我们得去弄个开瓶器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you go, dude. - Fuck, we need an opener.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.94,0:29:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 - 嘿 丹尼到哪去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Hey! Where's Danny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.71,0:29:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出去捕猎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out hunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.95,0:29:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 丹尼吗 - 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What, Danny? - What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.08,0:29:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 还记得那几个老太婆吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Remember the little gaggle of old ladies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.79,0:29:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 - 她们中有一个擅离职守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Well, one of them went AWOL.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.26,0:29:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去他的老年痴呆症 伙计 那他妈的跟杀手一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking Alzheimer's, dude. It's a fucking killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.63,0:29:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你得去找一下丹尼 - 现在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need to go get Danny. - Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.93,0:29:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.74,0:29:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快就要天黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna get dark soon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.90,0:29:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想他一个人留下来 跟那些人在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't like him alone with these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.54,0:29:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了解 跟老妈似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.78,0:29:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不喜欢你这样哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ain't gonna like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确定我们不要 - 嘘…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure we don't... - Sh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.25,0:29:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要许可什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...need a permit or anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.39,0:29:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每一个人都有他自己的生活原刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every man lives by his own set of rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.63,0:30:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说到这个 我该教你怎么捕猎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of which, time to introduce you to the hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一步 你要侦查一下 然后延伸开来去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First you gotta scout, then stretch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.95,0:30:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鹿会觉得安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace the deer feels safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人们到不了的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where men can't get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.43,0:30:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你的区域设诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bait your area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.50,0:30:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用你的方式引诱鹿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lure, entice the deer over your ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.01,0:30:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要去追赶你的猎物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna go after your prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.55,0:30:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是要让你的猎物自己送上门来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let your prey come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.79,0:31:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是耐心的问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.33,0:31:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要比那些动物聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And being smarter than the animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.24,0:31:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.24,0:31:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准它们肩部以上的部位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aim for the upper shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.82,0:31:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,颈部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.22,0:31:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.72,0:31:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一次瞄准 射击到位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A one-shot kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.77,0:31:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们要来查看一下流血的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we check the blood trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.61,0:32:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带着气泡的粉色血液代表着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pink blood with air bubbles means{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.15,0:32:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你射中了它的心脏或者是肺部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've hit the heart or the lung.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.75,0:32:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是你要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.28,0:32:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血呈暗红 你可能是射中了它的肝脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dark red, you probably hit the liver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.72,0:32:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雄鹿会挺一段时间 但是过一会它们就会挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yhe buck may hang in there, but they will die soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.69,0:32:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血色很淡的还带了点胆汁的 你就得去追踪它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watery blood with bile, you may have to track the deer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.40,0:32:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后再射一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deliver another shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.31,0:32:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它可能会想要冲出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may try to bolt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.65,0:32:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你己经瞄准了 那正好有了反作用力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you've aimed just right, it'll be pure reflex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.82,0:32:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,射得很好 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good shot, Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 接下来要做什么 - 没有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do we do next? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.83,0:32:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是暗红色的血 它很快就会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dark red blood. Besides, he'll be dead soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.63,0:32:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有太多的肉能拿回去了 快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have more than enough meat back home. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.43,0:32:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能就这样离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just leave it like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.07,0:33:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来杀了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.24,0:33:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.11,0:33:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它可能会用后腿反踢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may have some kick left in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.08,0:33:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肩部以上的部位 颈部或者是脑部 去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Upper shoulder, neck or brain. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.18,0:33:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做得很好 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.85,0:33:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.91,0:34:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 你对着那堆干草做什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, what did you do to this weed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.01,0:34:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.74,0:35:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.24,0:35:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.91,0:35:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在流血 - 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're bleeding. - So are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.58,0:35:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何大多数血都不是我的 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of it's not mine anyway. Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.72,0:35:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开这里 他看到我的脸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta get out of here! He saw my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.99,0:35:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁 你绊倒了吗 - 没有 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? Are you tripping? - Not anymore, I'm not.{\r}
