Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.42,0:46:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但是这个地方 - 很棒 还能再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But this place... - Was great. And it can be again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.92,0:46:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道关于经营旅馆 或是温泉的一些东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even know anything about... about running a hotel, or a spa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.53,0:46:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是仅仅为了钱去做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not just doing it for the money.{\r}
