Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.60,0:46:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么能比拍摄一伙朋友 重建里程碑更好的了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What better way to film a group of friends restoring a great landmark.{\r}
