Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.27,0:55:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to stop 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.44,0:55:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上让他们停止是个小奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact they stopped at all is a small miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.04,0:55:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们就是不听话 - 那就今夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're just not listening. - Tonight then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.78,0:55:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们让他们今夜见到丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have them all meet Danny tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.51,0:55:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.72,0:56:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.19,0:56:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带他去厨房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him to the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.19,0:56:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一会把他埋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll carve him up later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.90,0:56:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you fret, lover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.03,0:56:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会和我在一起 不管是什么形式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be in me, one way or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.23,0:56:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水管坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Water damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.60,0:56:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,故障管线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fried outlets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.84,0:56:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发霉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.61,0:56:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要更多的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need some more paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.84,0:57:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们知道丹尼想什么 会相当快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This would go a hell of a lot faster if we knew what Danny had in mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.28,0:57:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Danny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.88,0:57:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要找到这些地方的核心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need keys to some of these places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.88,0:57:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看前面的桌子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the front desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.42,0:57:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有当星期三亚当斯休息的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only if Wednesday Adams is on a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.19,0:57:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 维克 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vic. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.89,0:57:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走 但是你要去找你的男朋友 这都是他的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go, but you go get your boyfriend. This was all his idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.42,0:57:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.06,0:57:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.00,0:57:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托妮 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toni! Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.80,0:58:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以用小指导出去 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could all use a little guidance out there, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.94,0:58:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.28,0:58:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这都是你干的吗 - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you do all this? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.08,0:58:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是吉利安的 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Jillian's. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.48,0:58:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是想要拿走这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was she trying to take these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.02,0:58:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.15,0:58:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她和布里经常去甩货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She and Bry were always going on about selling things off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.12,0:58:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问过你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without asking you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.96,0:58:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说到钱 布莱恩做得糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it comes to money, Bryan's done worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.63,0:58:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在哪看到过他们吗 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you seen them anywhere? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.33,0:58:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他们带走了一些离别礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like they took off with a few parting gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.80,0:58:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然这不像是他们的所作所为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not like them, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.37,0:58:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我猜你从不曾真正了解任何人 哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess you never really know anybody, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.54,0:58:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三年来我们都不曾了解他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've known them for three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.68,0:58:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 他们简单又粗爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, all they've ever been about is the quick and easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.31,0:58:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩和他的次贷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bryan with his subprimes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.92,0:58:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉利安扮演着她的曼哈顿上流婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Jillian playing the Manhattan socialite bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.82,0:58:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 丹尼 - 她来自威斯康辛州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Danny! - She's from Wisconsin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.39,0:58:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是 我给了他们上来的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I gave 'em a chance to get in on the ground floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.39,0:58:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人们自己努力 上帝也不会给机会让他们成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God forbid they ever achieve anything in life by actually working for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.79,0:58:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是我在这里努力要做的事 - 哇哦 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what I'm trying to do here. - Wow, Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.23,0:59:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们是你的朋友 - 你知道为什么布莱恩如此渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They are your friends. - You know why Bryan's so eager{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.50,0:59:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在公司的时候让我回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get me back in the firm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.83,0:59:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他不必做任何的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he didn't have to do any work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.50,0:59:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总能得到更大的提升 看到我付出什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always did the heavy lifting, and look what that cost me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.91,0:59:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们是我过去的生活… 这是我现在的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're my old life. This... this is my new one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.01,0:59:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 我现在真的非常努力地变得有能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God! I am really trying hard to be supportive right now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.35,0:59:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我唯一不想知道的就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the only person I don't feel like I know is you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.05,0:59:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在说什么啊 - 就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - It is this place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.38,0:59:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想把我带到这里来 - 因为我以为这样会有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanted to bring me here. - Because I thought it was gonna help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.25,0:59:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实有 萨莉都发现了异样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it has! Even Sally noticed the difference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.02,0:59:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 从我来这里的时候 - 噢 我的天 萨莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- from when I got here. - Oh, my God. Sally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.59,0:59:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢 不要再说了 - 你想把 不不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, don't start that again. - You wanna bring up... No, no! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.19,0:59:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她和她的兄弟/老公/表亲/无论是啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her and her brother/husband/cousin/whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.10,0:59:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 够了 妈的 - 他们是唯一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enough of that shit! - They are the only ones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.23,0:59:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道关于他们的一切 你怎么就不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we really know nothing about! How do you not get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.77,0:59:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道 自己去问他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna know something? Go ask them yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.67,0:59:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你有吗 你查证过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, have you? Have you checked into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.21,0:59:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉你的一切吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anything that they've told you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.38,0:59:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们只是对我很好 - 难道没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They have been nothing but kind to me. - And we haven't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.11,0:59:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不懂 - 哦 我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't understand. - Oh, my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.12,0:59:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这些人是我 - 什么 他们是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- These people are my... - What?! What are they?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.35,0:59:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 你从来就不知道 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you even know? You don't even know, Danny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.86,1:00:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.53,1:00:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.60,1:00:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 没事 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's OK. It's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.50,1:00:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 杰克森 萨莉 - 这里 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jackson? Sally? - In here, Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.31,1:00:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我得和你们谈谈 - 我们会和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need to talk to you. - And we with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.68,1:00:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有太多事情需要解释了 我们不确定到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so many things we need to explain, we're just not sure how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.15,1:00:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这对你来说太震撼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure this is already so overwhelming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.95,1:01:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你再说一遍 - 我们很高兴你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You could say that again. - And we're thrilled that you're{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.32,1:01:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对这家宾馆感兴趣 - 但是已经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- interested in the hotel. - But it's already{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.15,1:01:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是关于我们是谁的一小方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just such a small aspect of who we really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.26,1:01:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.33,1:01:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们告诉你的话会比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's better if we show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.20,1:01:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你得一个人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta come alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.53,1:01:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的家人见到你会很满足的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's members of the family that have been aching to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.30,1:01:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 走吧 - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.35,1:01:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用手电简不是更方便吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't it be easier to use a flashlight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.78,1:01:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the way we do things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.35,1:01:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.18,1:02:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这些人是谁 - 他们都是亲戚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are all these people? - They're all kin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.42,1:02:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one way or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.49,1:02:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你回家 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to welcome you home, Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.92,1:02:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做这个多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.95,1:02:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从我们家族第一次踏上这片山丘的时候相识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've known each other since our clans first set foot in these hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.53,1:02:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些天有三个家族回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were three families back in those days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.76,1:02:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柯瑞顿 鲍格斯和希里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Craytons, the Boggles and the Hillickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.10,1:02:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是哪一个的 - 你是希里克家族的 丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which am I? - You're Hillicker, Danny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.70,1:03:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有你们呢 - 我们是血亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And all of you? - We're blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.97,1:03:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.74,1:03:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的家族征服了这片土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our families tamed this land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.28,1:03:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,获得了这里的回报 煤炭和木材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reaped its rewards, the coal, the timber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.91,1:03:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人想夺走我们获取的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others tried to chisel in on what we'd earned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.05,1:03:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是我们与生俱来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we had birthright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.62,1:03:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个给女士 这个给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's for the lady. That's for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.00,1:03:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是什么 - 家族红酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - It's the family vintage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.42,1:03:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 就像红酒一样 霍布温泉是一种家族的传承\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, like this brew, Hobb Springs is a testament to family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.16,1:03:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们四面八方的人聚集的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a place for our folk to gather from far and wide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.20,1:04:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和他们一起来的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With them came others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.51,1:04:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像和你一起来的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like your friends came with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.05,1:04:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们带着诱饵到处流浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they bring temptation to stray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.68,1:04:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,削弱我们的家族 弄脏我们的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weakened our family, muddied our blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.55,1:04:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着 你怎样维持家族的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, how do you preserve family strength?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.29,1:04:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎样使它一尘不染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you keep it pure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.63,1:04:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.00,1:04:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以坚守自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stick to our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.04,1:04:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么好怕的 亲爱的 没什么好怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to fear, sweetie. There's nothing to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.91,1:04:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们怎么了 - 纯洁的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to them? - It's the price of purity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.85,1:04:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纯洁…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purity...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.08,1:04:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坚守住我们自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick to our own...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.42,1:04:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是对的 丹尼 家族 叔叔 表亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, Danny. Family. Uncle, cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.32,1:04:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.69,1:05:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 传统已经成为了一种仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, what was tradition became ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.59,1:05:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这种仪式保留了我们的血统 甚至清除了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that ritual preserved our blood lines, it cleansed it even.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.40,1:05:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的贡献是强大的 但是当它被削弱的时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our devotion was strong and rewarded, but when it was weak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.77,1:05:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会得到惩罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we were punished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.94,1:05:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因此这是一代人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's been for generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.91,1:05:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 后来一切都变坏了 - 没有孩子再参与进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lately, everything has gone wrong. - No child comes to terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.18,1:05:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是那样 他们无法生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones that do, they don't survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.42,1:05:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这就是我们为什么需要你 丹尼 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And that's why we need you, Danny. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.12,1:05:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着 只有纯正的血统才能 维持这个家族的生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, only true blood will keep this family alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.26,1:05:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.39,1:05:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny, you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.86,1:05:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的血液一直是纯正的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our blood is still true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.03,1:05:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们本该在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It belongs together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.89,1:06:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the... Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.43,1:06:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.44,1:06:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.81,1:06:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.51,1:06:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 丹尼 - 我认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Danny! - I know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.61,1:06:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你想多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You only think you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.75,1:06:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.32,1:06:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! What the fuck?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.85,1:06:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我 我不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I... I don't know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.05,1:07:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新鲜的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flesh is life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.70,1:08:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长生不老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.88,1:09:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.79,1:09:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 各位 - 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guys. - Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.19,1:10:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夫哪 托妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, Toni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.69,1:10:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许是丹尼或维克 - 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe it's Danny or Vic. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.00,1:10:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个 托妮 退回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Toni, stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.07,1:10:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备 数三下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready? On three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.37,1:10:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.07,1:10:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢 该死 - 他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, shit! - Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.01,1:10:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 老兄 我们差点杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say, we almost killed you, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.74,1:10:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼 你怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny! What the hell happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.71,1:10:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 呃 - 什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Huh? - Wha...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.98,1:10:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 发生什么事情 - 我在喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - I was drinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.48,1:10:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喝很多 - 喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A lot. - Drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.52,1:10:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.82,1:10:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 搞烧烤 - 噢 耶 听起来很好的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Had a barbeque. - Oh, yeah, sounds nice. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.53,1:10:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们 我们不敢睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us? We were scared out of a sound sleep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.83,1:10:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被一群疯子放肆地敲门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by some maniac banging on the fucking door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.90,1:10:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔喔喔 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa! Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.93,1:10:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不想听这个 好吗 罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need this right now, Rod. OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.54,1:10:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼… 这些是抓痕吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danny... are these scratches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.67,1:10:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 你应该知道的 哈 达 达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. You should know, huh? Da, da...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.88,1:10:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 停停 - 嘿 拜托 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop. Stop. - Hey, come on, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.41,1:10:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 丹尼 - 拜托 起开 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Danny. - Come on, get off. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.35,1:11:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 好的 - 我们得马上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, all right. - Listen, we need to leave right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.59,1:11:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 我到家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck that. I'm home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.29,1:11:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.26,1:11:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么 你们可以走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? You guys can leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.03,1:11:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩和吉利安 他们走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bryan and Jillian, they did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.70,1:11:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 维克走了 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vic did. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.37,1:11:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 维克走了 - 维克怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vic left? - Danny, what happened to Vic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.03,1:11:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the fuck should I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.67,1:11:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 想走吗 - 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanna go? - Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.47,1:11:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 - 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.98,1:11:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道什么 伙计们 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, guys? I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.32,1:11:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不可以让我好好睡会 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just let me get some sleep, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.29,1:11:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 我从来没有看他这么糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I've never seen him this fucked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.96,1:11:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 你们可以扶他上楼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Should you guys carry him upstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.50,1:11:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 或做点什么 - 耶 维克怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- or something? - Yeah, but what about Vic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.33,1:11:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们闻到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you guys smell that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.24,1:11:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 - 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on. - Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.50,1:12:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 他妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.31,1:12:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.12,1:12:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得弄走丹尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get Danny to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.53,1:12:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管他愿不愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether he wants to or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.24,1:13:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来 查理 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, Charlie! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.38,1:13:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托妮 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toni, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.09,1:13:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把托妮带走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Toni out of here right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.60,1:13:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.77,1:14:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.60,1:14:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.49,1:14:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.27,1:15:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪里 罗德 我们得找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he, Rod? We have to find him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.44,1:15:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们先走 再带人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! We go and come back for help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.70,1:15:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们不能丢下他 - 他想留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can't leave him here! - He wants to stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.11,1:15:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不懂吗 我想他清楚目前的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get that?! I think he knows what's been going on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.34,1:15:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
