Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.50,1:17:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 求你别开枪 - 丹尼在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please don't shoot me. - Where's Danny?{\r}
