Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.47,1:18:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在属于他的地方 - 你们对他做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where he belongs. - What did you do to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.98,1:18:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们做了什么 - 他喜欢那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you do something to him? - But he liked it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.82,1:18:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道你是谁 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know what you are. I do.{\r}
