Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.13,1:20:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在杀我的家人 - 家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're trying to kill my family now? - Family?{\r}
