Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.24,1:20:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不了解我了 我已经不是从前的我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know me anymore. I've changed.{\r}
