Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.04,1:20:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你伤害我妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fucking hurt my sister. Huh?!{\r}
