Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.71,1:20:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说停下 - 哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said stop! - Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.94,1:20:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我不能听你的 丹尼 她知道得太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I can't do that, Danny. She knows an awful lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.71,1:20:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人会相信她的话 这点她明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will believe her. She knows that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.22,1:21:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 不能就这么放过她 - 你还有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh! That is not enough! - You have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.85,1:21:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在是希里克 你不需要她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a Hillicker now. You don't need her too.{\r}
