Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.50,1:21:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - 我说让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I said I'll do it.{\r}
