Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.38,1:22:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在你杀了我们中的一个 - 我不杀他 我就会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now you've gone and killed one of us. - He was trying to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.72,1:22:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不会杀你们的 - 我帮不了你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't happening. - I can't help you anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.49,1:22:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 丹尼 你不是这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stop, Danny! This isn't you!{\r}
