Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.48,1:23:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计们 还好吗 这地方怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys, how are you? Find the place OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.78,1:23:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到希里克温泉庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Hillicker Springs.{\r}
