Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.74,1:24:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我已经减掉了6磅 - 哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've already lost six pounds. - Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.01,1:24:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续坚持哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go disappearing on us now, OK?{\r}
